246 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 160 0 R/T(What better way to help you gain knowledge, tools for calm and control and shed loads of resources than Hypnobirthing?)/E(What better way to help you gain knowledge, tools for calm and control and shed loads of resources than Hypnobirthing?)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

247 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 160 0 R/T(But FYI.... Hypnobirthing doesn't involve being hypnotised; instead, it teaches you how your body works on a muscular and hormonal level when in labour and how you can use various relaxation techniques to ensure you are working with your body \(rather than against it\), making birth more efficient and comfortable.)/E(But FYI.... Hypnobirthing doesn't involve being hypnotised; instead, it teaches you how your body works on a muscular and hormonal level when in labour and how you can use various relaxation techniques to ensure you are working with your body \(rather than against it\), making birth more efficient and comfortable.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

