321 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 166 0 R/E(So we know how fear of labour and birth can affect the body physically during the birthing process, now let\220s look at all the things we can do in pregnancy to add positive information about birth to our subconscious and change our mindset around birth!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

322 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 166 0 R/E(We take in negative thoughts on birth from what we see or hear. TV shows, movies and documentaries are a huge reason that many people fear birth. Along with horror stories from friends and family and unhelpful headlines in the media, it\220s not surprising that most people are not looking forward to birthing their baby!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

323 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 166 0 R/E(What can we do to change our mindset into a positive one instead? )/Pg 17 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

324 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 166 0 R/T(Write down all the things you can think of and then make sure to start using them to make you feel informed and excited to birth your baby.)/E(Write down all the things you can think of and then make sure to start using them to make you feel informed and excited to birth your baby.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

325 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 166 0 R/T(building a positive mindset)/E(building a positive mindset)/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
