<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 167 0 R/E(1. List all of the things that you are worried about, the things that come up when you think of birth below. Let\220s get this stuff of your chest and out of your mind!)/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

331 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 167 0 R/E(2. Once you\220ve written them down give them a rating of 1 - 5. 1 being less worried and 5 being most worried.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
