346 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 168 0 R/E(Affirmations are sentences created to affect the conscious and the subconscious mind so that in turn, they affect our behaviour, thinking patterns, habits, and environment. The words composing the affirmation, automatically and involuntarily, bring up related mental images into the mind, which inspire, energize and motivate. The affirmations and the resultant mental images get engraved on the subconscious mind, which in turn, changes the behaviour, habits, actions, and reactions according to the repeated words.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

347 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 168 0 R/E(Example: I\220m worried about how I will handle the contractions becomes \215I surrender to the rhythm of birth, knowing I am capable of handling each moment gracefully\216)/Pg 19 0 R/K[7]>>
