560 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 182 0 R/E(The BRAIN acronym is an important decision making tool that everyone should know when accessing maternity care. It can be used to make decisions regarding scans, treatment, monitoring, tests, interventions and birth plans.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[3]>>
