830 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(Why home birth? \(If you\220ve decided to have a home birth then it\220s handy to know this sort of info for conversations with friends and family if you wish to tell them your plans \(many prefer not to if they don\220t expect support\).)/Pg 59 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

831 0 obj
