endobj

835 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(-No need to sort childcare/ petcare )/Pg 59 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

836 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(It\220s generally very safe! Studies show that home birth is as safe as hospital for first time birthers and safer than hospital for second time birthers. There is thought to be an increase in poorer outcomes for baby but we must remember that this includes lower apgar scores at birth \(but actually baby is totally healthy\).)/Pg 59 0 R/K[26]>>
endobj

