2122 0 obj
<</Title(Do you have an area that you can use to birth? You can give birth in any size house, room etc. Many babies are born in small bathrooms and bedrooms. Basically if there\220s space to live there then there is space to birth there! Some people who live in shared houses for example and can\220t guarantee privacy and would rather go to an MLU instead.)/Dest[60 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2124 0 R/Next 2120 0 R>>
endobj

2123 0 obj
<</Title(-Explain birth plan A and answer any questions.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2121 0 R/Next 2125 0 R>>
endobj

