2159 0 obj
<</Title(- There are many other things that people swear by for late pregnancy encouraging baby to arrive, there is limited research into a lot of things \(which doesn\220t mean they can\220t be effective\) so read into anything you are considering and consult your midwife. Here are some commonly recommended ways of encouraging babies arrival gently- dates, acupuncture, reflexology, visiting a chiropractor, evening primrose oil, clary sage oil, dancing, nipple stimulation and orgasms \(you probably don\220t need to ask your midwife if those are ok! Just be mindful not to pop anything in your vagina once your waters have released\).)/Dest[54 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2161 0 R/Next 2157 0 R>>
endobj

